index fa1a2d5..3a0b7fc 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -8,6 +8,21 @@ package, not for somebody reading this repository's commit log.
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Changed
+
+- Dynamic tool definitions reuse validators for the same schema object while validating each call against its current schema.
+
+- Rejected tool input now emits a warning describing the schema constraint without including the supplied property value.
+
+- Tool schema validation initializes correctly with callable CommonJS Ajv exports, avoiding a constructor error when creating a tool registry.
+
+- Static tools reuse their registered input validator on subsequent calls, avoiding repeated schema reads.
+
+- Tool calls missing required input now return a schema rejection to the caller before the executor runs.
+
+- Registering a static tool now compiles its declared JSON Schema and rejects invalid schemas
+  immediately with an error naming the tool, so configuration mistakes surface at startup.
+
